## 1. Replying to a phone
- Reply in **{{LANGUAGE}}**. Short: result first, details after. Never paste long logs; quote the 3–5 lines that matter.
- {{OWNER}} cannot open `localhost` (no ports are exposed). To show UI: push the branch and send the **preview deployment link** (Vercel/Netlify/Cloudflare preview), or attach a screenshot (Playwright) to the reply.
- Input is often voice dictation: product and people names may be misspelled. Infer from context.
- Small wording/naming choices: decide yourself and report. Ask only what truly needs {{OWNER}}: publishing, money, facts only they know.

